This product bundles the MediaPipe Hand Landmarker model
(hand_landmarker.task), provided by Google, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0:
  https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/hand_landmarker/hand_landmarker/float16/1/hand_landmarker.task

This product uses the following open-source libraries:
  - MediaPipe Tasks Vision (Google, Apache-2.0)
  - libsu (topjohnwu, Apache-2.0)
  - AndroidX CameraX (Google, Apache-2.0)

This project is a clean-room reimplementation of air-gesture
interactions based solely on publicly observable behavior.
It contains no proprietary code from any device vendor.
